# Lab UI

This is a control surface, not a landing page. If a change is visual, open the page at **1366×768**, screenshot it, and read the screenshot before you ship.

- First screen: session state, Listen/Stop, her playback, See, transcript. Extra labs stay collapsed.
- Status sits **next to Listen**, never alone in a far corner.
- Labels must parse as one idea. `See: Off|Camera|Screen` is fine. `Video source: Audio only` is not.
- Do not repeat the same noun on two adjacent controls (`What Gemini sees` + `Show what Gemini sees`).
- **Hear her** = her playback. **Listen/Stop** = your mic. Never one "Mute" that could mean either.
- Copy is protocol-short and readable. No hero titles. No paragraphs above the first button.
- Mouse path is left-to-right on one row: Idle → Listen → Stop → Hear her.

```html
<!-- BAD -->
<select><option>Audio only</option></select>
<label>Show what Gemini sees</label>

<!-- GOOD -->
<label>See <select><option>Off</option><option>Camera</option><option>Screen</option></select></label>
<label><input type="checkbox" /> Preview</label>
```
